end us a message and we&#x27;ll get back to you shortly.<br/><br/>You can send us a message by filling out the adjacent form or by emailing us at<!-- --> <a style="color:inherit" href="mailto:support@ondo.finance">support@ondo.finance</a></p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1rr4qq7"><div class="MuiBox-root css-17pef6a"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyM-az css-16bz5og">We&#x27;re always improving the client experience, growing liquidity, providing more options, and building our one-of-a-kind community one brick at a time. If you provide a first-class digital assets service that incorporates our products we want to hear from you!</p><div class="MuiStack-root css-1sb7ptk"><div class="MuiStack-root css-1b4jwz8"><div class="MuiStack-root css-el2he9"><div variant="secondary" type="text" data-testid="first-name-input" class="base-FormControl-root base--required css-nk1i1k"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="first-name">First Name *</label></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1kxonj9"><div class="base-Input-root base-Input-formControl css-1iz9geh"><input required="" id="first-name" type="text" class="base-Input-input" value=""/></div></div></div><div variant="secondary" type="text" data-testid="last-name-input" class="base-FormControl-root base--required css-nk1i1k"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="last-name">Last Name *</label></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1kxonj9"><div class="base-Input-root base-Input-formControl css-1iz9geh"><input required="" id="last-name" type="text" class="base-Input-input" value=""/></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root css-el2he9"><div type="email" data-testid="email-input" class="base-FormControl-root base--required css-nk1i1k"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="email">Email *</label></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1kxonj9"><div class="base-Input-root base-Input-formControl css-1iz9geh"><input required="" id="email" type="text" class="base-Input-input" value=""/></div></div></div><div type="text" variant="secondary" data-testid="organization-input" class="base-FormControl-root css-nk1i1k"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="organization">Organization</label></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1kxonj9"><div class="base-Input-root base-Input-formControl css-1iz9geh"><input id="organization" type="text" class="base-Input-input" value=""/></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root css-el2he9"><div class="MuiBox-root css-17jj4a0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="investor-type">Investor Type *</label></div><div data-testid="amount-select" class="base-FormControl-root css-rg8nz7"><button role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_16kpkqdaktkl5fiuujmtb_" id="investor-type" class="base-Select-root css-1rf7zwg"><span class="notranslate">​</span></button><input tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="border:0;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;white-space:nowrap;width:1px" value=""/><div class="MuiBox-root css-ct1qci"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="translate(3.74 7.94)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.06066 0L8.26066 7.2L15.4607 0L16.5213 1.06066L8.26066 9.32132L0 1.06066L1.06066 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-17jj4a0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="amount-of-interest">Amount of Interest *</label></div><div data-testid="amount-select" class="base-FormControl-root css-rg8nz7"><button role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_16l9kqdaktkl5fiuujmtb_" id="amount-of-interest" class="base-Select-root css-1rf7zwg"><span class="notranslate">​</span></button><input tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="border:0;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;white-space:nowrap;width:1px" value=""/><div class="MuiBox-root css-ct1qci"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="translate(3.74 7.94)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.06066 0L8.26066 7.2L15.4607 0L16.5213 1.06066L8.26066 9.32132L0 1.06066L1.06066 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div variant="secondary" data-testid="message-input" class="base-FormControl-root base--required css-w3gptq"><div class="MuiStack-root css-4jfph9"><label class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelXS css-k285mh" for="message">Message *</label></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1kxonj9"><div class="base-Input-root base-Input-formControl base-Input-multiline css-1iz9geh"><textarea required="" id="message" rows="4" class="base-Input-input base-Input-multiline"></textarea></div></div></div><div class="base-FormControl-root base-FormControl-filled css-1bhurfc"><input type="checkbox" class="css-c6j6dr"/><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-labelM css-199bxgb">I am a<!-- --> <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-87d7tw" href="https://docs.ondo.finance/qualified-access-products/eligibility#possible-qualified-purchaser-criteria" target="_blank" rel="norferrer noopener" style="color:inherit;text-decoration-color:inherit">Qualified Purchaser</a></p></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root css-wzufs4"><button type="button" data-testid="contact-submit-button" class="base-Button-root css-1ifo3fl">Submit</button><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyXS-gx css-so9u31">By submitting, you agree to receive updates, insights and news from us. This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google<!-- --> <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-87d7tw" style="color:inherit;text-decoration-color:inherit" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways css-87d7tw" href="https://policies.google.com/terms" style="color:inherit;text-decoration-color:inherit">Terms of Service</a> <!-- -->apply.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="product-section MuiBox-root css-0"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl css-1fxfsev"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4-gx css-1jht16z"><span style="display:flex;flex-direction:column"><span style="display:block;overflow:hidden;padding-block:0.1em;margin-block:-0.1em;padding-inline:0.1em;margin-inline:-0.1em"><span style="display:block;opacity:0;transform:translateY(100%)">FAQ</span></span></span></h2><div class="MuiBox-root css-1ldtm3l"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded css-dsw8r4"><div class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root css-1j0p9u3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-content css-1n11r91"><div class="MuiStack-root css-8xp9cs"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyL-gx css-yc8xdy">Who is eligible to buy OUSG?</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-mshyre"><svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.7742 11.2258V4H11.2258V11.2258H4V12.7742H11.2258V20H12.7742V12.7742H20V11.2258H12.7742Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden css-a0y2e3" style="min-height:0px"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical css-hboir5"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical css-8atqhb"><div role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root css-fiumyq"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyM-az css-ik1fxj">Organizations or individuals in eligible countries - including the US - who have onboarded to our Qualified-Access Funds can invest in, redeem, or transfer, or receive OUSG. See all the ways you can qualify<!-- --> <a target="_blank" style="color:inherit" href="https://docs.ondo.finance/qualified-access-products/ousg/eligibility-&amp;-onboarding">here</a>.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded css-dsw8r4"><div class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root css-1j0p9u3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-content css-1n11r91"><div class="MuiStack-root css-8xp9cs"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyL-gx css-yc8xdy">How is OUSG backed?</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-mshyre"><svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.7742 11.2258V4H11.2258V11.2258H4V12.7742H11.2258V20H12.7742V12.7742H20V11.2258H12.7742Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden css-a0y2e3" style="min-height:0px"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical css-hboir5"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical css-8atqhb"><div role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root css-fiumyq"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyM-az css-ik1fxj">The significant majority of this portfolio is currently in the BlackRock USD Institutional Digital Liquidity Fund (BUIDL), with the remainder in BlackRock&#x27;s FedFund (TFDXX), bank deposits, and USDC for liquidity purposes. The portfolio may, in the future, include other US Treasury funds and/or direct investments in US Treasuries.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded css-dsw8r4"><div class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root css-1j0p9u3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-content css-1n11r91"><div class="MuiStack-root css-8xp9cs"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyL-gx css-yc8xdy">How do I invest?</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-mshyre"><svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.7742 11.2258V4H11.2258V11.2258H4V12.7742H11.2258V20H12.7742V12.7742H20V11.2258H12.7742Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden css-a0y2e3" style="min-height:0px"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical css-hboir5"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical css-8atqhb"><div role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root css-fiumyq"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyM-az css-ik1fxj">To invest, you must first onboard to our Qualified-Access Funds. Once you complete onboarding, you can invest either USD via wire transfer or via any supported stablecoin.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded css-dsw8r4"><div class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root css-1j0p9u3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-content css-1n11r91"><div class="MuiStack-root css-8xp9cs"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyL-gx css-yc8xdy">What is the minimum I can invest in OUSG?</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-mshyre"><svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12.7742 11.2258V4H11.2258V11.2258H4V12.7742H11.2258V20H12.7742V12.7742H20V11.2258H12.7742Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden css-a0y2e3" style="min-height:0px"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical css-hboir5"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical css-8atqhb"><div role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root css-fiumyq"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyM-az css-ik1fxj">For instant transactions, the minimum amount is<!-- --> <span><span>$<!-- -->5K<!-- --> for both investments and redemptions</span></span>. For non-instant transactions, our minimum investment and redemption amounts are $100K and $50K, respectively.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1yuhvjn"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="color:initial;text-decoration-color:#626262" href="https://docs.ondo.finance/qualified-access-products/ousg/overview"><div class="MuiStack-root css-1wydv7a"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-bodyS-gx css-m1n1gc">See our full FAQ</p><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g transform="translate(4.84 5.28)"><path d="M13.1373 2.55362L1.06066 14.6302L0 13.5696L12.0638 1.50578L3.88117 1.5L3.88223 0L14.6373 0.00760127L14.6373 10.7556L13.1373 10.7556L13.1373 2.55362Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1acxkij"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl css-11lxkg4"><div class="MuiStack-root news-band css-yflusu"><div class="MuiStack-root css-fes76t"><div class="Mui