d by any Onchain Portfolio, and any Onchain Portfolio may differ from the corresponding Portfolio Strategy for a variety of reasons. BlackRock shall have no obligation to provide updates to each Portfolio Strategy after the initial delivery of the Portfolio Strategy to Ondo except in certain limited circumstances. It is at Ondo’s arrangement whether any related Onchain Portfolio is similarly updated. Therefore, the Onchain Portfolios may not incorporate changes in the market or other events nor update in line with the Portfolio Strategies. BlackRock has no investment advisory, investment management, fiduciary, client or other relationship with, and owes no responsibilities or duties to, any investor or prospective investor in the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. The Portfolio Strategies are not designed to be suitable for any specific investor and do not take into account the individual needs, objectives or risk tolerance of any investor or prospective investor. BlackRock has not prepared or approved this document or any other offering or marketing material, and is not responsible for the tokenization, issuance, distribution, custody, or operation of the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. BlackRock is not making any offer to sell nor soliciting any offer to buy any securities. An investment in the Tokens involves risk, including the possible loss of principal, and past performance is not indicative of future results.\n\nInvestors have no right, title, interest, or claim in or to any of the funds or securities underlying any Onchain Portfolio (the “Underlying Funds”) or any recourse to any manager of the Underlying Funds, and such Underlying Funds are not being offered, marketed, or distributed to Investors by BlackRock or Ondo, whether directly or indirectly through the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. The Tokens constitute separate and distinct securities issued by Ondo and do not represent any interest in the Underlying Funds.\n\nThe Portfolio Strategies will include funds sponsored and managed by BlackRock and its affiliates, which will pay fees to BlackRock and its affiliates for providing management, administrative, or other services. Accordingly, BlackRock has a potential conflict of interest in connection with providing the Portfolio Strategies, as an investment in such funds by the Onchain Portfolio will increase compensation to BlackRock and its affiliates. BlackRock has an incentive to provide a Portfolio Strategy that contains funds that would result in increased levels of compensation being paid to BlackRock and its affiliates by such funds.\n\nAdditional information about BlackRock, including its Form ADV, is available from the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission’s Investment Adviser Public Disclosure website at https://adviserinfo.sec.gov."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"footerContent\":{\"disclaimers\":[{\"pathname\":\"/\",\"content\":\"$16\"},{\"pathname\":\"/ousg\",\"content\":\"$17\"},{\"pathname\":\"/ondo-stocks\",\"content\":\"$18\"},{\"pathname\":\"/usdy\",\"content\":\"$19\"},{\"pathname\":\"/intelligent-portfolios\",\"content\":\"$1a\"}],\"secondaryDisclaimers\":[{\"pathname\":\"/intelligent-portfolios\",\"content\":\"$1b\"}],\"footnotes\":[{\"pathname\":\"/\",\"items\":[\"¹ APY (Annual Percentage Yield) is accurate as of 2025-12-29. For USDY, APY is set monthly by Ondo in accordance with the USDY governing documents. For OUSG, APY is calculated by annualizing the increase in price over the past 30 days.\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/ousg\",\"items\":[\"¹ APY is generally updated each weekday, excluding holidays. APY is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 30 calendar days preceding and including the day that APY is updated. This yield reflects past performance. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Actual yields may vary depending on market conditions and other factors.\",\"² Yields are generally updated each weekday, excluding holidays. 7-Day Yield is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 7 calendar days preceding and including the day that the 7-Day Yield is updated. 30-Day Yield is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 30 calendar days preceding and including the day that the 30-Day Yield is updated. These yields reflect past performance. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Actual yields may vary depending on market conditions and other factors.\",\"³ Current Value excludes OUSG limited partnership interests represented in book-entry (non-tokenized) form.\",\"⁴ Other Assets consists funds in transit, outstanding receivables less payables\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/ondo-stocks\",\"items\":[\"¹ Subject to certain jurisdictional and other restrictions (including non-availability in the US).\",\"² This directory of companies includes formal partners as well as companies in the space that may have integrated Ondo products without any formal relationship with Ondo. The directory list does not indicate an endorsement by Ondo of any of the entities on the directory and users are responsible for their own diligence and understanding as to the products and services provided by any entity on the directory.\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/ecosystem\",\"items\":[\"* This directory of companies includes formal partners as well as companies in the space that may have integrated Ondo products without any formal relationship with Ondo. The directory list does not indicate an endorsement by Ondo of any of the entities on the directory and users are responsible for their own diligence and understanding as to the products and services provided by any entity on the directory.\"]}]},\"children\":[\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"22:I[24564,[\"4940\",\"static/chunks/1059d7ef-811472ce6753b3ee.js\",\"3249\",\"static/chunks/990a3170-72b6573bb8f462f2.js\",\"6940\",\"st